      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091425">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091430">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091432">Multiply packed single precision floating-point values in xmm3/m128 with xmm2 and store result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
